      <description>Table of images used to create the image mosaic of M2 Deimos.  All images used for
the mosaic are Viking Orbiter images.  Their geometry is discussed in Benesh and
Thorpe (1975).  Approximate pixel scale is 0.0000248.  Thus, at a range of 1000 km,
the scale is 24.8 m/pixel. Longitudes are west.</description>
